WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.255
The Trifid, from the newest telescope.

00:02.926 --> 00:06.749
The Trifid Nebula, with the dark lanes of dust that give it its name.

00:07.245 --> 00:14.340
It was among the very first pictures from the Vera Rubin Observatory in Chile, released in June 2025.

00:14.950 --> 00:19.729
For ten years that telescope will photograph the southern sky every few nights.
